  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Meet at the Creek**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **Angeline the Baker**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: China Doll, Airmail Special [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2017-09-15.flac.24** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 17 songs; 100 min [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2017-09-15.flac.24**: taped by George Hodges,Jr.; transferred by George Hodges, Jr.; source: Post show matrix [1]. Also: Audience recording used Audix M1280c microphones, recorded to a Tascam DR-70D at 24-bit/48kHz; Taped directly in front of the soundboard with mics about nine feet up; a separate soundboard feed was also captured on the Tascam; George Hodges, Jr. recorded and transferred it via SDHC card, PC and WaveLab 6.1, with matrixing and edits there, FLAC level 8 [1]",
